{"t":{"GAJA Baltijos Brasta vannas sieniņa":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/gaja.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"67\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/gaja.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"286\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/gaja_.jpg\" alt=\"\" />Augstums 1500mm<br />\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bezrāmju siena minimālisma stilā. Ir atverama tikai&nbsp; uz āru</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">.</span></p>","SVAJA 2 un SVAJA 2 PLUS Baltijos Brasta vannas siena":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/svaja+_.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"68\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"130\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/svaja2_.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/svaja+.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"130\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"102\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/svaja2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\r\n<p><strong>SVAJA 2&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Augstums 1935mm</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify;\">Ļoti kompakta, ar divām durvīm. Labi izmantojama vannas istabās ar sarežģītu plānojumu.</span></p>\r\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\">\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;SVAJA 2 PLUS&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/svaja2+_.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" width=\"207\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/svaja2+_.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/svaja2+.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" width=\"85\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/svaja2+.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a></p>\r\n<p>Sienas augstums 1450mm.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify;\">Vannas siena ar 2 durvīm, kas ir izvietotas vannas centrā.</span></p>","DORA Baltijos Brasta bezrāmja dušas siena":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/bzr.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"72\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/bzr.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a>Augstums 1900mm.</p>\r\n<p>Komplektā turētāja garums 850-1000mm.</p>","MEDA Baltijos Brasta":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/meda.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"63\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/meda.jpg\" /></a><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/meda_.jpg\"><img hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" width=\"172\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/meda_.jpg\" /></a>Augstums 1500mm</p>","CARLA vannas siena":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/sserv/round.png\"><img width=\"107\" hspace=\"5\" height=\"130\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/sserv/round.png\" /></a>Aizveramas vannas sienas vairākos standartizmēros 1,5m garumā.  Uzstādāmas uz vannas malas tie&scaron;i pie sienas. Ērti lietojamas, viegli  kopjamas un lieliski izskatās!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nVannas sienu stikli ir pieejami 4 dažādos toņos: caurspīdīgs, bronza,  pelēks vai matēts balts.</p>","ESTETICO vannas siena":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/sserv/sky.png\"><img width=\"102\" hspace=\"5\" height=\"130\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/sserv/sky.png\" /></a> Aizveramas vannas sienas vairākos standartizmēros 1,5m garumā.  Uzstādāmas uz vannas malas tie&scaron;i pie sienas. Ērti lietojamas, viegli  kopjamas un lieliski izskatās!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp; Vannas sienas eņģe ir atverama  180 grādos, aprīkota ar lifta mehānismu, fiksējas noregulētajā pozīcijā.  Vannas sienu stikli ir pieejami 4 dažādos toņos: caurspīdīgs, bronza,  pelēks vai matēts balts.</p>","MAJA un MAJA PLUSS Baltijos Brasta vannas sieniņas":"<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/maja.png\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/Maja_schema.jpg\" width=\"120\" height=\"116\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" />Bezrāmju siena minimālisma stilā. Siena bez rāmjiem un no ļoti dro&scaron;a rūdītā 6 mm bieza stikla.Viegli tīrāma.<br />\r\n</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10.6667px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\">Sienas augstums&nbsp; (mm) 1500</strong></p>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\r\n<table width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\">\r\n    <tbody>\r\n        <tr>\r\n            <td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n        </tr>\r\n    </tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<div><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/maja plus.png\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" />Bezrāmju siena minimālisma stilā. Siena bez rāmjiem un no ļoti dro&scaron;a rūdītā 6 mm bieza stikla.Viegli tīrāma.</span></div>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>","LAURA Baltijos Brasta dušas siena":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/laura.png\" width=\"87\" height=\"130\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" /><img src=\"/userfiles/Image/santeh/leishi/LAURA_sh.jpg\" width=\"100\" height=\"78\" hspace=\"5\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" />Du&scaron;as siena minimālisma stilā. Laikā, kad du&scaron;as siena netiek izmantota, to var novietot paralēli sienai.<br />\r\n</span><strong style=\"color: rgb(116, 116, 116); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 8pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Sienas augstums (mm) 1900</span></span></strong></p>","MIJA vannas siena":"<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(93, 93, 93); font-family: Roboto; font-size: 11px; text-align: center;\">Sienas augstums&nbsp; (mm) 1500</span><img src=\"https://www.brastaglass.lv/image/cache/image58db96f644e37-250x375.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"150\" align=\"left\" hspace=\"5\" alt=\"\" /></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>"}}